---
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24" id="mobilni-web">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-20 items-center">

      <!-- Left: phone -->
      <div class="reveal flex justify-center md:justify-start">
        <div class="mockup-phone w-[160px] md:w-[220px]">
          <div class="phone-body">
            <div class="phone-island"></div>
            <div class="phone-screen">
              <img src="/screenshot-mobile.webp" alt="Web hezkewebovky.cz na mobilu" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="phone-btn phone-btn-r"></div>
            <div class="phone-btn phone-btn-l1"></div>
            <div class="phone-btn phone-btn-l2"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: text -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="text-text-muted text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-5">Mobilní zařízení</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.08] mb-6">
          Web, který vypadá<br/>
          <span class="text-accent">skvěle všude</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md mb-8">
          Přes polovinu návštěvníků přichází z mobilu. Každý web stavím tak, aby fungoval perfektně na telefonu, tabletu i počítači – bez kompromisů.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-text-secondary text-base">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-accent/15 border border-accent/40 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            Plně responzivní design
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-text-secondary text-base">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-accent/15 border border-accent/40 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            Rychlé načítání i na mobilních datech
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-text-secondary text-base">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-accent/15 border border-accent/40 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            Optimalizace pro Google (Core Web Vitals)
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mockup-phone {
    filter:
      drop-shadow(0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.65))
      drop-shadow(0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4));
  }

  .phone-body {
    position: relative;
    background: #111;
    border-radius: 40px;
    padding: 11px;
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.12),
      0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }

  .phone-island {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 70px;
    height: 20px;
    background: #000;
    border-radius: 20px;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .phone-screen {
    border-radius: 30px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 88%, transparent 100%);
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 88%, transparent 100%);
  }
  .phone-screen img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .phone-btn {
    position: absolute;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .phone-btn-r  { right: -3px; top: 90px;  width: 3px; height: 44px; border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0; }
  .phone-btn-l1 { left: -3px;  top: 70px;  width: 3px; height: 24px; border-radius: 2px 0 0 2px; }
  .phone-btn-l2 { left: -3px;  top: 103px; width: 3px; height: 44px; border-radius: 2px 0 0 2px; }
</style>
